ts and poor trade decisions. Secondly, the strategy's reliance on technical indicators like moving averages, RSI, and MACD may have been insufficient to capture the complexities and nuances of the market during the stress regime. Additionally, the strategy's stop-loss mechanism, which is based on a fixed percentage of the Donchian high, may have been too conservative, resulting in premature exits from profitable trades or failures to limit losses. The strategy's performance may have also been impacted by the relatively low number of closed trades, which could indicate that the strategy is too conservative or hesitant to enter trades, potentially missing out on profitable opportunities. To improve the strategy's performance, it may be necessary to incorporate more advanced sentiment analysis techniques, refine the technical indicators, and optimize the stop-loss mechanism to better adapt to changing market conditions.	[0.021824734,0.03885954,-0.036985315,-0.039829843,0.007677716,0.03372851,-0.024884645,0.04338459,0.016653925,-0.112072445,-0.04255095,0.04848527,-0.0017473211,-0.0006195938,-0.004119397,0.006714208,0.049372133,-0.05405437,0.005449577,0.011398199,-0.009693324,-0.008310577,-0.009367697,-0.0054282825,0.025794765,0.0013335657,0.012971556,-0.024815897,0.027781824,0.22760366,-0.02451231,-0.03809511,0.003518266,-0.00093110447,-0.017093357,0.0050395634,0.0063860463,-0.029538246,0.02319504,0.021433147,0.011663256,0.020022826,0.050168365,0.05104404,0.032904427,-0.023032922,0.0023714402,0.027291467,-0.019870779,-0.0043523666,-0.031694632,-0.0033201436,0.026755746,0.005781201,0.016613098,0.020764189,0.0030930443,0.005019857,0.047462665,-0.012400535,-0.049127646,0.026239516,0.053804997,0.0003301805,0.049120713,-0.0035588082,-0.018103236,0.02835667,-0.0010696962,-0.043519694,0.02088305,-0.009031702,-0.0136088645,-0.016739698,-0.027957488,-0.041464053,-0.03607809,0.027612267,-0.037735086,0.04924504,0.022406746,-0.024311656,-0.03738242,0.014976875,0.022542218,0.0840399